  "content": "<p><strong>遇到問題或擔心模組不相容？請查看<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>。</strong></p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8Se8aWc_JNg\">\n</iframe></span></span><h4>免責聲明：此預告片並非資料包功能的 1:1 完整呈現</h4><h1>👨‍🌾 人形村民</h1><p><em>這個資料包將那些乏味的村民替換為玩家角色！名稱、外觀和對話均為隨機生成，且由於完全基於數據驅動，可輕鬆擴展內容。</em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"fapi-badge\"></a></p><p><em>^ 僅在 Fabric 或 Quilt 平台遊玩時需要</em></p><h2>🔗 相關連結</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EclipseStudiosMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252feclipse-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"github-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EclipseStudios447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"patreon-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/elgeroingles/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252felgeroingles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/ElGeroIngles/860767aa976892908afff9f2c4b9648f/raw/eda5e7344a38837c32e34a1c0f8a4de180d38d5c/planet_minecraft_cozy.svg\" alt=\"planet_minecraft\"></a></p><h2>❤️ 特別感謝…</h2><h4>🔧 技術支援與工具…</h4><ul>\n<li>我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>中的 <code>@thepieslayer</code> 和 <code>@tyllrrrr</code> 提供的對話建議。</li>\n<li><code>@aksiome</code> 和 <code>@ethanout</code> 在射線投射系統上的協助。</li>\n<li><code>@merak48763</code> 在人偶模型方面的幫助。</li>\n</ul><hr><h4>🌐 支援語言（貢獻者）…</h4><ul>\n<li>英文（en_us）：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>西班牙文（es_es）：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 提供。</li>\n</ul><p>您可以透過翻譯其他語言來參與此專案！詳情請見<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><h2>🛠️ 擴充套件</h2><p>想學習如何製作新增名稱、外觀和對話的<strong>擴充套件</strong>嗎？請參閱<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>！</p><h2>📝 實用資訊</h2><p>需要專案的相關資訊嗎？請查閱其<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/humanoid_villagers/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>！</p>",
